# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# ── Subject ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, header <= 72 chars
#   types : feat fix docs test refactor perf build ci chore revert
#   scopes: core transport session routes clients services server
#           accounts cdp http proxy profile post search message
#           tools tests ci docs deps release
#   examples:
#     feat(search): paginate results with page_info.end_cursor
#     fix(accounts): keep cookies out of the repository
#     docs: document the incognito test matrix
#
# ── Body (optional, blank line above) ────────────────────────────────────────
#   Why is this change needed? What was wrong before?
#   How does behaviour change? Anything reviewers must verify?
#   Wrap at 100 characters.
#
#
# ── Footer (optional, blank line above) ──────────────────────────────────────
#   Refs: #123
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to migrate
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. Hooks: `make hooks`.
